 was the first to suggest utilizing guerilla war tactics, and he also...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_14","text":"Did you say guerilla war tactics?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_15","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_16","text":"New Hope!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_18","text":"New Hope? New Hope? Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_19","text":"What's all this about New Hope?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_20","text":"Him! That's New Hope!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_21","text":"No way! That's... er... what's going on?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_22","text":"Let's just say his reputation precedes him.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_23","text":"Oh, gotcha.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_24","text":"New Hope! I'm your biggest fan! Can I have your autograph?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_herecomestrouble","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_25","text":"Are you Master's senior officer? Should we refer to you as Mega Master?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_28","text":"I can't believe it! The real New Hope, in the flesh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_29","text":"Mega Master! Mega Master! Mega Master!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_30","text":"Be quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_33","text":"From now on, no one calls me Big J, New Hope, or anything else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_34","text":"Yes, Mega Master!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_35","text":"... And not