t to be proud.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_43","text":"Respect?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_44","text":"Everything I left behind has crumbled and faded into nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_45","text":"How can I possibly deserve anyone's respect?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_47","text":"If you really are the famous New Hope, you don't seem to fit the description.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_intotheswarm","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_48","text":"He partook in the Second Surface Reclamation Campaign nearly 60 years ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_49","text":"You know your history.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_50","text":"He was also detained in the Rehabilitation Center after being charged with treason.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_51","text":"According to official records, he died from gunshot wounds sustained during a failed escape attempt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_52","text":"Official records? On whose authority, exactly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_53","text":"The Central Government, I presume?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_54","text":"... Right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_55","text":"I'm in no mood to explain every last detail to you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_56","text":"but rest assured, I am the New Hope that you all are talking about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_57","text":"I don't care what anybody says, New Hope is my nickname, and mine alone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_58","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_58","text":"Johan walks forward without us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_59","text":"Wait, did he just call himself New Hope? I thought that word was banned.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_60","text":"Yeah!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_62","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_62","text":"So, where are we going?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_63","text":"Follow me, and you'll find out soon enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_64","text":"This isn't another test or anything like that, is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_65","text":"You all are guests of Eden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_66","text":"We both have fought a common enemy, and we consider you our allies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_67","text":"Allies?! Aren't they more like our backup?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_68","text":"You better watch yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_69","text":"Not that I need any backup anyway. I'm waaaay stronger than any of you. If you're so jealous, then just get stronger!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_70","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_71","text":"What, got nothing to say? Did I hit a nerve?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_72","text":"You wanna go toe-to-toe without any weapons?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_73","text":"... Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_74","text":"Level the playing field. Just our fists. How about it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_75","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_76","text":"Wh-what kind of nonsense is this? Why would I waste my time sparring with such weaklings?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_77","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_77","text":"Noah marches off almost like she's fleeing the scene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_78","text":"Isn't she adorable?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_79","text":"You mean, infantile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_80","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_81","text":"You okay, Isabel? You look like something's on your mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_82","text":"I can't take it anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_83","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_84","text":"I put up with it all the way until we got to Eden, but now that we're all working together...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_85","text":"I've got to get closer to my beloved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_86","text":"I want to take in every last inch and bask in my darling's presence. I need it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_87","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_87","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_88","text":"... Um... You go ahead and do that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_89","text":"Do I not need Johan's permission?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_90","text":"I doubt he will care.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_02_e_91","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_02_e_91","text":"Hey, what about me?","jum